   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "Para lo que pasó y se acabó: **Fui ao Porto** (fui a Oporto). Para describir cómo estaba todo: **Estava sol e as ruas estavam cheias** (hacía sol y las calles estaban llenas). Para algo ya hecho antes: **Quando cheguei, já tinha almoçado** (cuando llegué, ya había almorzado).",
     "@en": "For what happened and it's over: **Fui ao Porto** (I went to Porto). To describe how it was all: **Estava sol e as ruas estavam cheias** (it was sun and the streets were full). For something already done before: **Quando cheguei, já tinha almoçado** (when I arrived, I had already had lunch)."
    }
   ]
  },
